---
import "@/styles/site.scss";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>삼화명조 · Samhwa Myeongjo</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicons/favicon.ico" sizes="any" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicons/favicon-32x32.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="samhwa-showcase">
    <main class="samhwa-stage">
      <h1 class="samhwa-title" lang="ko">삼화명조</h1>
      <div class="samhwa-passage" lang="ko">
          “자연은 보석을 만들기 위해 얼마나 많은 세월을 보냈는가? 또 그 보석이 채굴의 운을 만나기까지 얼마나 많은 세월을 조용히 빛나고 있었는가?”라는 구절이다. 그 외에는 요령부득으로 끝났다. 그 대신 이 시간에는 끝까지 스트레이 십이라는 글자를 한 번도 쓰지 않았다.
        <cite>현암사 역 『산시로』 발췌</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="samhwa-back">
        <a href="/misc/">← 돌아가기</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* Override the site's constrained body for a full-page showcase. */
  body.samhwa-showcase {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text-color);
  }

  .samhwa-stage {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 4rem 8vw 1.5rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* 삼화명조, large and horizontal. */
  .samhwa-title {
    font-family: "OnulSamhwa", "source-han-serif-sc", serif;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 16vw, 14rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .samhwa-passage {
    max-width: 60rem;
    font-family: "OnulSamhwa", "source-han-serif-sc", serif;
    font-size: 3rem !important; /* large body text */
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .samhwa-passage p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .samhwa-passage cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    font-size: 2.0rem !important;
    font-style: normal;
    text-align: right;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Back button: a black-outlined rectangle, aligned right, with a quick
     hover/press response. */
  /* Same width + centering as .samhwa-passage, so its right edge lines up
     with the paragraph's right end; text-align pins the button there. */
  .samhwa-back {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .samhwa-back a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.55em 1.4em;
    border: 2.5pt solid currentColor;
    color: var(--text-color);
    background-color: transparent;
    font-family: "OnulSamhwa", adobe-caslon-pro, serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      transform 0.08s ease;
  }

  .samhwa-back a:hover,
  .samhwa-back a:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--text-color);
    color: var(--bg-color); /* invert fill on hover */
  }

  .samhwa-back a:active {
    transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98); /* brief press feedback */
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .samhwa-passage {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .samhwa-passage cite {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
